# Unity writes its text assets (scenes, prefabs, .asset, .meta) with LF.
# Pin LF here so core.autocrlf on Windows does not turn every save into a
# line-ending-only diff. Scoped to the Unity project; the web version at the
# repository root keeps its existing behaviour.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets Git should never try to diff or convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.psd binary
*.tga binary
*.exr binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.fbx binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
